  "notes": [
    "Data on the Component ALSO carries flow_id/view_id/flow_type directly (redundant with the FieldMapping trio) — same double-encoding pattern seen on metrics.json; write both.",
    "iconField's Property is Type:\"Object\" holding a small {Name,Type,_id} descriptor rather than a plain scalar Value — a genuinely structured (not just typed-hint) Property, unlike every FM_type:\"Icon\"/\"String\"/\"Number\" seen elsewhere which still hold a plain Value.",
    "filterParameters' Property is Type:\"FilterParam\" with NO Value key at all when unset — a third Property \"shape family\" (Value / Object / FilterParam) alongside the plain-Value one used everywhere else.",
    "Content Container Type is \"MasterDetail\" — a sixth distinct Container Type value alongside Body/Container/Component/Popup/Tab.",
    "Real ids typically use the manifest_id prefix only on a fresh single-widget add (e.g. `Button_<10-char-rand>`, `Metrics_<10-char-rand>`) — the scenario this template mints for — while built-up production pages (`all_pages_draft_20260806.json`) mostly carry the generic `Component_<rand>` id instead, and Repeater/Tab/MasterDetail/Breadcrumbs were never observed prefixed at all."
  ]
